    col6Meses: "6 months",

    rentabilidadEtfsTitulo: "ETF returns",
    rentabilidadEtfsDesc: "Compares the index's return with that of its comparable UCITS ETFs (distributing for every index except the DAX, which, being computed as a total-return index, needs the opposite: accumulating — the index is computed from ex-dividend prices, and only the type of ETF that also drops on the ex-dividend date is comparable on those terms). Below, the rest of the UCITS ETFs for the same index, of the opposite type, are also shown (in orange, by name): they aren't comparable with the index for the same reason, but are included so they can still be checked. Green marks periods where the ETF beats the index; red marks periods where it falls short.",
    rentabilidadEtfsBotonCargando: "Checking...",
    rentabilidadEtfsBoton: "Check ETF returns",

    rentabilidadEtfsTodosTitulo: "All ETF returns",
    rentabilidadEtfsTodosDesc: "Same as the tool above, but going through every index that has at least one reference ETF (the PSI 20 and the whole ADR index series are excluded, since they have none), one after another — to compare across indices at a glance, or download/share a single combined PDF.",
    rentabilidadEtfsTodosBotonCargando: "Checking every index...",
    rentabilidadEtfsTodosBoton: "Check all ETF returns",
